Package: katu-installer
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Katu OS Team <katuos@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt5 | python3-pyside6, calamares, katu-release
Priority: optional
Section: misc
Description: Katu OS installer wizard
 Friendly installation wizard designed for Brazilian users.
 Guides through: system requirements check, disk selection,
 user creation, installation progress and reboot.
 Launches Calamares for the actual installation.
